OrionLayer open fix 95 — the Stellar Converter's two totals as a battle event
=============================================================================

Work order 266 (260 P1, Data's decision of work order 262). orion2re on the
fork's branch `orionlayer` (v2.0.0), on top of open fix 94; commit cb2bf131.
Not on `orionlayer-local`. Every line under ORION2RE_EXT.

Stellar_Converter (cmbtspec.cpp:986-1084) draws its line, THEN does four
hits through CMBTFIRE::Apply_Ship_Damage, summing the damage and the
structure damage in two locals, and shows them over the target
(Add_Damage_Indicator_For_Ship, then Draw_Damage_Message_Queue_Until_Done).
The two sums were on no wire, so a client showed no numbers after the
converter (every other hit's pair is in its own event, open fix 56).

CEV_CONVERTER_HIT (25): source, target, damage, structure damage — recorded
by Combat_Note (open fix 82: it keeps open fix 79's tick count) after the
four hits, before the numbers are queued. Nothing in the game's play
changes.

